<title>FRANCE: One flour ship expected in Rouen very shortly.</title>
<headline>One flour ship expected in Rouen very shortly.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship was expected in Rouen very shortly to load some 10,000 tonnes of flour, port officials said.</p>
<p>The destination for the flour was not specified, they said.</p>
<p>In Rouen one ship was currently loading 3,000 tonnes of flour destined for West Africa.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
